 # OpenCensus Exporter
 
-Exports traces and/or metrics to another Collector via gRPC using OpenCensus format.
+Exports traces and/or metrics via gRPC using
+[OpenCensus](https://opencensus.io/) format.
 
 The following settings are required:
 
